Quest 329 "Stamp of Strength"
    Journal for karus "A Stamp of Strength is required for learning 70Lv and 80Lv skills, and [Warrior Master] Skaki will make it for you if you bring him 5 Fangs of Bakirra, 5 Venomous Tails of Shaula and 2 packs of Magic Powder, which are the required materials for Stamp of Strength."
    Journal for elmorad "A Stamp of Strength is required for learning 70Lv and 80Lv skills, and [Warrior Master] Skaki will make it for you if you bring him 5 Fangs of Bakirra, 5 Venomous Tails of Shaula and 2 packs of Magic Powder, which are the required materials for Stamp of Strength."
    Collect 1 of 379042000
    Collect 1 of 379040000
    Collect 2 of 379236000

Requires player level >= 69

Rewards
    Give 1 of 379243000

On offer
    Say "You are now fast approaching the ultimate warrior level."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "We warriors have been thinking for a long time on the limit of our abilities. And as a result, we discovered the special skill filled with the last of our spirit and strength, and we recognized it as our final limit. And it is time for you to be handed down with that last secret skill. Since it is the last secret skill, the process of making it is also very complex. First, you need a Stamp of Strength and Nostrum of Constitution.  But these two items cannot be obtained from somewhere straightaway.  Such"

On in_progress
    Say "To make a Stamp of Strength, you need  1 Fangs of Bakirra, 1 Venomous Tails of Shaula, 2 Magic Powders and you can't afford to miss any one of them."

On ready
    Say "Master, all the ingredients needed to make the Stamp of Power have been amassed. The ultimate secret weapon of the warrior... I can't wait to witness it."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Wow... every single ingredient is here. The Stamp of Power will soon be completed. Please wait. This is the Stamp of Power. It is an essential object for completing the ultimate skill of the warrior."
